rver.handle_msg/6\n    (stdlib 6.2.2.2) proc_lib.erl:329: :proc_lib.init_p_do_apply/3\nLast message (from #PID<0.379.0>): {:handle_conflict, {192, 168, 1, 100}, <<18, 52, 86, 120, 154, 188>>, \"default\"}\nState: %{total_conflicts: 0, total_reassignments: 0, quarantined: %{}, quarantine_time: 3600}\nClient #PID<0.379.0> is alive\n\n    (stdlib 6.2.2.2) gen.erl:260: :gen.do_call/4\n    (elixir 1.18.4) lib/gen_server.ex:1125: GenServer.call/3\n    test/yellow_dog/dhcpv4/conflict_resolver_test.exs:119: YellowDog.Dhcpv4.ConflictResolverTest.\"test handle_conflict/3 with LeaseManager list_quarantined returns conflict records\"/1\n    (ex_unit 1.18.4) lib/ex_unit/runner.ex:511: ExUnit.Runner.exec_test/2\n    (stdlib 6.2.2.2) timer.erl:595: :timer.tc/2\n    (ex_unit 1.18.4) lib/ex_unit/runner.ex:433: anonymous fn/6 in ExUnit.Runner.spawn_test_monitor/4\n\n\n  4) test handle_conflict/3 with LeaseManager list_quarantined returns conflict records (YellowDog.Dhcpv4.ConflictResolverTest)\n     test/yellow_dog/dhcpv4/conflict_resolver_test.exs:112\n     ** (exit) exited in: GenServer.call(YellowDog.Dhcpv4.ConflictResolver, {:handle_conflict, {192, 168, 1, 100}, <<18, 52, 86, 120, 154, 188>>, \"default\"}, 5000)\n         ** (EXIT) an exception was raised:\n             ** (KeyError) key :static_reservations not found in: %{\n       name: \"default\",\n       range_start: {192, 168, 1, 100},\n       range_end: {192, 168, 1, 200},\n       subnet_mask: {255, 255, 255, 0},\n       gateway: {192, 168, 1, 1},\n       dns_servers: [{192, 168, 1, 1}],\n       domain_name: \"test.local\",\n       lease_time: 86400,\n       excluded_ranges: []\n     }\n                 (yellow_dog_dhcpv4 0.1.0) lib/yellow_dog/dhcpv4/address_pool.ex:224: YellowDog.Dhcpv4.AddressPool.get_static_reservation/2\n                 (yellow_dog_dhcpv4 0.1.0) lib/yellow_dog/dhcpv4/address_pool.ex:170: YellowDog.Dhcpv4.AddressPool.get_available_ip/3\n                 (yellow_dog_dhcpv4 0.1.0) lib/yellow_dog/dhcpv4/c