pace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/ex_dns/README.md-281-## Performance Considerations\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/ex_dns/README.md-282-\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/ex_dns/README.md-283-### Domain Name Compression\napps/ex_dns/README.md:284:Domain name compression is implemented in `DNS.Message.Domain.parse_domain_from_message/2` with security measures to prevent compression loop attacks.\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/ex_dns/README.md-285-\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/ex_dns/README.md-286-### Binary Pattern Matching\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/ex_dns/README.md-287-The library heavily utilizes Elixir's pattern matching on binaries for efficient DNS protocol parsing, particularly in performance-critical paths.\n--\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/ex_dns/README.md-300-- Validate all binary input data before processing\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/ex_dns/README.md-301-- Implement rate limiting for DNS message processing\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/ex_dns/README.md-302-- Use proper cryptographic libraries for DNSSEC operations\napps/ex_dns/README.md:303:- Monitor for compression loop attacks in domain name parsing\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/ex_dns/README.md-304-\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/ex_dns/README.md-305-## Contributing\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/ex_dns/README.md-306-\n--\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/ex_dns/CLAUDE.md-101-### Security Considerations\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/ex_dns/CLAUDE.md-102-\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/ex_dns/CLAUDE.md-103-**Domain Compression Depth**\napps/ex_dns/CLAUDE.md:104:Domain name decompression in `DNS.Message.Domain` is vulnerable to compression loop attacks. Implementation must include depth limits.\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/ex_dns/CLAUDE.md-105-\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/ex_dns/CLAUDE.md-106-**Binary Data Validation**\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/ex_dns/CLAUDE.md-107-Record length fields (rdlength) require validation to prevent memory exhaustion attacks. Critical in `DNS.Message.Record.from_iodata/2`.\n--\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/ex_dns/lib/dns.ex-48-\napps/ex_dns/lib/dns.ex-49-  The library includes comprehensive security protections:\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/ex_dns/lib/dns.ex-50-\napps/ex_dns/lib/dns.ex:51:  * DNS compression loop attack prevention\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/ex_dns/lib/dns.ex-52-  * Input validation bounds checking\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/ex_dns/lib/dns.ex-53-  * Path traversal protection\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/ex_dns/lib/dns.ex-54-  * Centralized error handling\n--\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/ex_dns/lib/dns/message/domain.ex-61-\napps/ex_dns/lib/dns/message/domain.ex-62-  defp parse_domain_from_message(<<pointer::2, pos::14, rest::binary>>, message, depth, visited)\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/ex_dns/lib/dns/message/domain.ex-63-       when pointer == 0b11 do\napps/ex_dns/lib/dns/message/domain.ex:64:    # Check for compression loop detection\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/ex_dns/lib/dns/message/domain.ex-65-    _current_pos = byte_size(message) - byte_size(rest) - 2\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/ex_dns/lib/dns/message/domain.ex-66-\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/ex_dns/lib/dns/message/domain.ex-67-    if MapSet.member?(visited, pos) do\n--\napps/ex_dns/lib/dns/message/domain.ex-70-        visited_positions: MapSet.to_list(visited)\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/ex_dns/lib/dns/message/domain.ex-71-      })\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/ex_dns/lib/dns/message/domain.ex-72-\napps/ex_dns/lib/dns/message/domain.ex:73:      throw(Error.new(:com