{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017aewAbAZ8fZWMahUzBSjcc","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! Now I have comprehensive information. Let me create my report with all the findings:\n\n## YellowDog Codebase Improvement Opportunities Report\n\nBased on my comprehensive analysis of the YellowDog codebase, I've identified prioritized improvement opportunities across code quality, test coverage, performance, documentation, and security.\n\n---\n\n## 1. CRITICAL: Incomplete Feature Implementations (High Priority)\n\n### 1.1 DNS Zone Stub Resolution Not Implemented\n**Files:**\n- `/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/yellow_dog_dns/lib/yellow_dog/dns/zone/stub.ex` (lines 100-104)\n\n**Issue:** The stub zone resolver returns `{:error, :not_implemented}` instead of actual resolution logic.\n\n```elixir\ndef handle_call({:resolve, _query}, _from, state) do\n  state = %{state | query_count: state.query_count + 1}\n  # TODO: Implement stub zone resolution\n  {:reply, {:error, :not_implemented}, state}\nend\n```\n\n**Impact:** Stub zones cannot forward queries to upstream nameservers.\n**Effort:** Medium\n\n---\n\n### 1.2 DHCPv6 Prefix Delegation Not Integrated\n**Files:**\n- `/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/yellow_dog_dhcpv6/lib/yellow_dog/dhcpv6/handler.ex` (lines 681-702)\n\n**Issue:** Placeholder implementation with TODO comment. PrefixPool module exists but isn't integrated into handler.\n\n```elixir\ndefp allocate_prefix_delegation(duid, iaid) do\n  # TODO: Integrate with PrefixPool module\n  # Example placeholder prefix: 2001:db8:1000::/56\n  {:ok, %{delegated_prefix: {{0x2001, 0x0DB8, 0x1000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0}, 56}, ...}}\nend\n```\n\n**Impact:** DHCPv6 prefix delegation (IA_PD) returns hardcoded prefixes instead of managing real pools.\n**Effort:** Medium\n\n---\n\n### 1.3 Console DNS/Zone Management Backend Not Implemented\n**Files:**\n- `/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/yellow_dog_console/lib/yellow_dog/console/live/dns_live/rr_live/index.ex` (lines 201, 226)\n- `/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/yellow_dog_console/lib/yellow_dog/console/live/dns_live/zone_live/index.ex` (line 195)\n\n**Issues:**\n- Bulk add records: `# TODO: Implement actual bulk add via zone API` (line 201)\n- Delete records: `# TODO: Implement actual RR delete via zone API` (line 226)\n- Zone import: `# TODO: Implement zone file parsing and import` (line 195)\n\n**Impact:** UI shows forms but operations fail silently or show pending messages.\n**Effort:** Medium\n\n---\n\n## 2. IMPORTANT: Unimplemented Core Features (Medium Priority)\n\n### 2.1 DNS Firewall Check Missing\n**File:** `/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/yellow_dog_dns/lib/yellow_dog/dns/connection_process.ex` (line 359)\n\n```elixir\nnew_state = update_query_phase(new_state, query_id, @phase_firewall)\n# TODO: Implement firewall check\nnew_state = update_query_phase(new_state, query_id, @phase_view_routing)\n```\n\n**Impact:** No firewall/ACL enforcement at DNS connection level; all queries pass through.\n**Effort:** Medium\n\n---\n\n### 2.2 DNS In-Flight Query Cancellation Not Implemented\n**File:** `/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/yellow_dog_dns/lib/yellow_dog/dns/view.ex` (line 282)\n\n```elixir\ndef handle_info({:cancel_query, _query_id}, state) do\n  # TODO: Cancel in-flight resolution\n  {:noreply, state}\nend\n```\n\n**Impact:** DNS queries initiated for cancellation continue processing anyway.\n**Effort:** Low\n\n---\n\n### 2.3 RPZ Policy Evaluation Placeholder\n**File:** `/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/yellow_dog_dns/lib/yellow_dog/dns/view.ex` (line 443)\n\n```elixir\n# TODO: Implement RPZ policy evaluation\n```\n\n**Impact:** Response Policy Zones (RPZ) feature is non-functional for post-resolution filtering.\n**Effort:** High\n\n---\n\n## 3. DOCUMENTATION GAPS (High Priority)\n\n### 3.1 Missing @moduledoc in 10 Console Modules\n**File