{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01E3ciR6RkyAsb5Y6mUhxWkG","type":"tool_result","content":"     1→defmodule YellowDog.Dns.Zone.Stub do\n     2→  @moduledoc \"\"\"\n     3→  Stub zone process.\n     4→\n     5→  A stub zone holds NS records for a zone and delegates queries\n     6→  to the authoritative servers listed in those NS records.\n     7→\n     8→  ## Features\n     9→\n    10→  - Holds NS records for delegation\n    11→  - Queries authoritative servers directly\n    12→  - Caches NS glue records\n    13→  \"\"\"\n    14→\n    15→  use GenServer\n    16→\n    17→  @behaviour YellowDog.Dns.Zone.Behaviour\n    18→\n    19→  alias YellowDog.Telemetry\n    20→\n    21→  defstruct [\n    22→    :name,\n    23→    :view_name,\n    24→    :ns_records,\n    25→    :created_at,\n    26→    query_count: 0\n    27→  ]\n    28→\n    29→  # Client API\n    30→\n    31→  @doc \"\"\"\n    32→  Starts a stub zone process.\n    33→  \"\"\"\n    34→  @spec start_link(keyword()) :: GenServer.on_start()\n    35→  def start_link(opts) do\n    36→    zone_name = Keyword.fetch!(opts, :name)\n    37→    view_name = Keyword.get(opts, :view_name, \"default\")\n    38→    GenServer.start_link(__MODULE__, opts, name: via_tuple(view_name, zone_name))\n    39→  end\n    40→\n    41→  @impl YellowDog.Dns.Zone.Behaviour\n    42→  def get_name(pid) do\n    43→    GenServer.call(pid, :get_name)\n    44→  end\n    45→\n    46→  @doc \"\"\"\n    47→  Gets the view name this zone belongs to.\n    48→  \"\"\"\n    49→  @spec get_view(pid()) :: String.t()\n    50→  def get_view(pid) do\n    51→    GenServer.call(pid, :get_view)\n    52→  end\n    53→\n    54→  @impl YellowDog.Dns.Zone.Behaviour\n    55→  def resolve(pid, query) do\n    56→    GenServer.call(pid, {:resolve, query})\n    57→  end\n    58→\n    59→  @impl YellowDog.Dns.Zone.Behaviour\n    60→  def reload(pid, config) do\n    61→    GenServer.call(pid, {:reload, config})\n    62→  end\n    63→\n    64→  @impl YellowDog.Dns.Zone.Behaviour\n    65→  def stats(pid) do\n    66→    GenServer.call(pid, :stats)\n    67→  end\n    68→\n    69→  # Server Callbacks\n    70→\n    71→  @impl true\n    72→  def init(opts) do\n    73→    zone_name = Keyword.fetch!(opts, :name)\n    74→    view_name = Keyword.get(opts, :view_name, \"default\")\n    75→    ns_records = Keyword.get(opts, :ns_records, [])\n    76→\n    77→    state = %__MODULE__{\n    78→      name: zone_name,\n    79→      view_name: view_name,\n    80→      ns_records: ns_records,\n    81→      created_at: DateTime.utc_now()\n    82→    }\n    83→\n    84→    Telemetry.info(\"Stub zone started\", %{name: zone_name})\n    85→\n    86→    {:ok, state}\n    87→  end\n    88→\n    89→  @impl true\n    90→  def handle_call(:get_name, _from, state) do\n    91→    {:reply, state.name, state}\n    92→  end\n    93→\n    94→  @impl true\n    95→  def handle_call(:get_view, _from, state) do\n    96→    {:reply, state.view_name, state}\n    97→  end\n    98→\n    99→  @impl true\n   100→  def handle_call({:resolve, _query}, _from, state) do\n   101→    state = %{state | query_count: state.query_count + 1}\n   102→    # TODO: Implement stub zone resolution\n   103→    {:reply, {:error, :not_implemented}, state}\n   104→  end\n   105→\n   106→  @impl true\n   107→  def handle_call({:reload, config}, _from, state) do\n   108→    ns_records = Keyword.get(config, :ns_records, state.ns_records)\n   109→    {:reply, :ok, %{state | ns_records: ns_records}}\n   110→  end\n   111→\n   112→  @impl true\n   113→  def handle_call(:stats, _from, state) do\n   114→    stats = %{\n   115→      name: state.name,\n   116→      ns_count: length(state.ns_records),\n   117→      ns_records: state.ns_records,\n   118→      query_count: state.query_count,\n   119→      created_at: state.created_at\n   120→    }\n   121→\n   122→    {:reply, stats, state}\n   123→  end\n   124→\n   125→  defp via_tuple(view_name, zone_name) do\n   126→   