reated `YellowDog.Console.Plugs.AuthRateLimiter` GenServer (ea14f3c)\n   234→  - ETS-based tracking of failed login attempts per IP\n   235→  - Token bucket style lockout after 5 failed attempts (configurable)\n   236→  - 5-minute lockout period by default (configurable)\n   237→  - Automatic cleanup of expired entries\n   238→  - Returns 429 Too Many Requests with Retry-After header\n   239→  - Support for X-Forwarded-For header (proxy deployments)\n   240→- [x] Integrated rate limiter with BasicAuth plug\n   241→  - Check rate limit before validating credentials\n   242→  - Record failures on invalid credentials\n   243→  - Reset counter on successful authentication\n   244→- [x] Added AuthRateLimiter to Console application supervisor\n   245→- [x] Added 12 comprehensive unit tests for rate limiter\n   246→- [x] All 1468+ tests pass across umbrella\n   247→\n   248→### Completed (Iteration 12 continued - Documentation & Tests)\n   249→- [x] Added @moduledoc to 11 console modules missing documentation (2c24860)\n   250→  - Router, Endpoint, Telemetry\n   251→  - DashboardLive\n   252→  - Dhcpv4Live.Index, LeasesLive, PoolLive\n   253→  - Dhcpv6Live.Index, LeasesLive, PoolLive\n   254→  - PageController\n   255→- [x] Created comprehensive DHCPv4 LeaseManager unit tests (ec33e3d)\n   256→  - 27 test cases covering all public API functions\n   257→  - start_link with pool configurations\n   258→  - allocate_lease operations (new MAC, existing MAC, pool range)\n   259→  - get_lease retrieval\n   260→  - release_lease and decline_ip\n   261→  - list_leases and get_allocated_ips\n   262→  - stats and pool management functions\n   263→  - static reservations\n   264→- [x] All 1494+ tests pass across umbrella\n   265→\n   266→### Completed (Iteration 13 - DHCPv6 LeaseManager Tests)\n   267→- [x] Created comprehensive DHCPv6 LeaseManager unit tests (b77d601)\n   268→  - 35 test cases covering all public API functions\n   269→  - start_link with pool configurations\n   270→ 