ons`** (basic wrapper)\n11. **`YellowDog.Dns.RecursionController`** (basic wrapper)\n12. **`YellowDog.Dns.ConfigPersistence`** (basic wrapper)\n\n**Also note:** Zone types have implementations but limited test coverage:\n- **`YellowDog.Dns.Zone.Forward`** (/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/yellow_dog_dns/lib/yellow_dog/dns/zone/forward.ex)\n- **`YellowDog.Dns.Zone.Auth`** (/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/yellow_dog_dns/lib/yellow_dog/dns/zone/auth.ex) - Has test\n- **`YellowDog.Dns.Zone.Cache`** (/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/yellow_dog_dns/lib/yellow_dog/dns/zone/cache.ex)\n- **`YellowDog.Dns.Zone.Stub`** (/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/yellow_dog_dns/lib/yellow_dog/dns/zone/stub.ex)\n- **`YellowDog.Dns.Zone.Rpz`** (/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/yellow_dog_dns/lib/yellow_dog/dns/zone/rpz.ex)\n- **`YellowDog.Dns.Zone.Root`** (/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/yellow_dog_dns/lib/yellow_dog/dns/zone/root.ex)\n\n---\n\n## Recommended Testing Priority\n\n**Phase 1 (Most Critical):**\n- mDNS: `NetworkMonitor`, `MessageCache`, `Responder`, `FileWatcher`\n- DHCPv4: `AddressPool`, `LeaseStorage`, `ConfigWatcher`\n- DNS: `ConnectionManager`, `ViewStore`, `AclStore`\n\n**Phase 2 (High Value):**\n- DHCPv6: `PrefixPool`, `RelayAgent`\n- DNS: `ZoneStore`, `AclRegistry`, `ZoneController`\n\n**Phase 3 (Medium Priority):**\n- DNS: Zone types (`Forward`, `Cache`, `Stub`, `RPZ`, `Root`)\n- Remaining wrapper modules"},{"type":"text","text":"agentId: a1eefad (for resuming to continue this agent's work if needed)"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b20a2ce5-4d1a-4dfb-8234-d009f9779d17","uuid":"eb1f6ceb-f913-479c-b6b9-e185c9156d53","tool_use_result":{"status":"completed","prompt":"Find modules in the yellow_dog umbrella project that might need additional test coverage. Look at:\n\n1. apps/yellow_dog_dns/lib/ - modules without corresponding tests\n2. apps/yellow_dog_mdns/lib/ - modules without c