functions\n   374→  - start_link/1 - various initialization scenarios\n   375→    - Valid config file and callback\n   376→    - Disabled state when enabled: false\n   377→    - Disabled state when no config file\n   378→    - Disabled state when file doesn't exist\n   379→    - Failure when reload callback missing\n   380→  - status/0 - returns watcher status\n   381→  - reload/0 - manual configuration reload\n   382→    - Callback invocation and error handling\n   383→    - Reload count and timestamp tracking\n   384→    - File read errors and callback failures\n   385→    - JSON and non-JSON config parsing\n   386→  - File watching - automatic reload on file changes\n   387→    - Triggers reload on file modification\n   388→    - Debounces rapid file changes\n   389→    - Ignores changes to other files\n   390→  - Edge cases: empty files, nested JSON, spaces in paths, symlinks\n   391→  - Documented behavior: callback exceptions crash GenServer\n   392→\n   393→### Completed (Iteration 16 continued - mDNS FileWatcher Tests)\n   394→- [x] Created comprehensive mDNS FileWatcher unit tests\n   395→  - 22 test cases (21 passing, 1 skipped)\n   396→  - start_link/1 - various initialization scenarios\n   397→    - Valid file path with JSON/TOML formats\n   398→    - Disabled state when enabled: false\n   399→    - Graceful handling when file doesn't exist\n   400→    - Format auto-detection from extension\n   401→  - status/0 - returns watcher status\n   402→    - Enabled/watching state\n   403→    - File path, reload count, last_loaded timestamp\n   404→  - reload/0 - manual configuration reload\n   405→    - Callback invocation and timestamp updates\n   406→    - Graceful error handling for invalid content\n   407→    - Handling deleted files\n   408→  - File watching - automatic reload on file changes\n   409→    - Ignores changes to other files in same directory\n   410→    - Handles rapid file changes\n   411→  - Edge cases: empty services, Unicode content, symlin