{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_011yofB4T9Mbf3DNBJD4GQgE","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect. Now I have all the information I need. Let me compile the final report:\n\n## Comprehensive Unit Test Coverage Analysis\n\nBased on a thorough search of all four applications, I've identified the Elixir modules missing or lacking unit tests. Here's the prioritized list of modules that could benefit from additional unit test coverage:\n\n---\n\n### **YELLOW_DOG_DNS (28 library modules, 11 test files)**\n\n**Critical Missing Tests (High Priority):**\n\n1. **ConnectionManager** (`apps/yellow_dog_dns/lib/yellow_dog/dns/connection_manager.ex`)\n   - DynamicSupervisor managing DNS connection lifecycle\n   - Complex: start_connection/4, stats/1, count_connections/1\n   - No corresponding test file\n\n2. **ConnectionProcess** (`apps/yellow_dog_dns/lib/yellow_dog/dns/connection_process.ex`)\n   - GenServer orchestrating async DNS query resolution\n   - Complex: concurrent query tracking, timeout handling, query state machine (7 phases)\n   - Handles raw DNS data parsing and telemetry spans\n   - No corresponding test file\n\n3. **RecursionController** (`apps/yellow_dog_dns/lib/yellow_dog/dns/recursion_controller.ex`)\n   - Implements iterative DNS resolution from root servers\n   - Complex: max depth enforcement, referral following, glue record handling\n   - UDP socket management and async response handling\n   - No corresponding test file\n\n4. **ConfigPersistence** (`apps/yellow_dog_dns/lib/yellow_dog/dns/config_persistence.ex`)\n   - Orchestration layer for DNS config persistence\n   - Complex: load_all/1, save_all/3, collect_views/1, collect_zones/1\n   - Coordinates with ViewStore and ZoneStore\n   - No corresponding test file\n\n**Important Missing Tests (Medium-High Priority):**\n\n5. **ZoneStore** (`apps/yellow_dog_dns/lib/yellow_dog/dns/zone_store.ex`)\n   - TOML persistence layer for zone metadata\n   - Complex: TOML parsing/formatting, atomic writes, backups, zone validation\n   - Zone type normalization and key parsing\n   - No corresponding test file\n\n6. **ViewStore** (`apps/yellow_dog_dns/lib/yellow_dog/dns/view_store.ex`)\n   - Persists DNS view configurations\n   - Complex: view configuration loading/saving\n   - No corresponding test file (mentioned in zones boundary tests)\n\n7. **ViewManager** (`apps/yellow_dog_dns/lib/yellow_dog/dns/view_manager.ex`)\n   - Supervisor managing DNS views\n   - Complex: view routing logic, concurrent view management\n   - No corresponding test file\n\n8. **View** (`apps/yellow_dog_dns/lib/yellow_dog/dns/view.ex`)\n   - Individual DNS view implementation\n   - Core component for query routing\n   - No direct unit tests (only boundary tests)\n\n9. **ZoneController** (`apps/yellow_dog_dns/lib/yellow_dog/dns/zone_controller.ex`)\n   - Supervisor managing DNS zones\n   - Coordinates zone lifecycle\n   - No corresponding test file\n\n10. **AclRegistry** (`apps/yellow_dog_dns/lib/yellow_dog/dns/acl_registry.ex`)\n    - Registry for ACL lookups\n    - No corresponding test file\n\n11. **AclStore** (`apps/yellow_dog_dns/lib/yellow_dog/dns/acl_store.ex`)\n    - Persistence layer for ACLs\n    - No corresponding test file\n\n12. **Supervisor** (`apps/yellow_dog_dns/lib/yellow_dog/dns/supervisor.ex`)\n    - Supervisor starting DNS components\n    - Conditional startup based on configuration\n    - No direct unit tests\n\n---\n\n### **YELLOW_DOG_DHCPV4 (15 library modules, 16 test files)**\n\n**Good coverage overall. Missing tests:**\n\n1. **Supervisor** (`apps/yellow_dog_dhcpv4/lib/yellow_dog/dhcpv4/supervisor.ex`)\n   - No corresponding test file\n\nAll other modules have test coverage (server_test.exs, pool_stats_test.exs, acl_test.exs, custom_options_test.exs, pool_config_test.exs, conflict_resolver_test.exs, handler_test.exs, rate_limiter_test.exs, option_parser_test.exs, lease_manager_test.exs, address_pool_test.exs, config_watcher_test.exs, lease_storage_test.exs)\n\n---\n\n### **YELLOW_DOG_DHCPV6 (11 library modules, 9 test files)**\n\n**Important Missing Tests:**\n\n1. **RelayAgent** (`apps/yellow_dog_dhcpv6/lib/yellow_dog/dhcpv6/relay_agent.ex`)\n   - DHCPv6 relay agent for multi-hop message forwarding\n   - Complex: decapsulate_relay_forward/1, encapsulate_relay_reply/2, relay chain handling\n   - Multi-hop relay support with nested encapsulation\n   - **No corresponding test file**\n\n2. **Supervisor** (`apps/yellow_dog_dhcpv6/lib/yellow_dog/dhcpv6/supervisor.ex`)\n   - **No corresponding test file**\n\nAll other modules have test coverage (address_pool_test.exs, handler_test.exs, lease_manager_test.exs, lease_storage_test.exs, option_parser_test.exs, prefix_pool_test.exs, rate_limiter_test.exs, server_test.exs)\n\n---\n\n### **YELLOW_DOG_MDNS (12 library modules, 11 test files)**\n\n**Missing Tests:**\n\n1. **Mdns (public API facade)** (`apps/yellow_dog_mdns/lib/yellow_dog/mdns.ex`)\n   - Public API delegating to submodules\n   - Complex: comprehensive service registration, discovery, and status APIs\n   - No corresponding test file\n\nAll other modules have test coverage (service_store_test.exs, service_registry_test.exs, server_test.exs, handler_test.exs, rate_limiter_test.exs, record_builder_test.exs, message_cache_test.exs, network_monitor_test.exs, responder_test.exs, file_watcher_test.exs)\n\n---\n\n## Summary Table\n\n| App | Missing Tests | Module Count | Test Count | Gap |\n|-----|----------------|-------------|-----------|-----|\n| **yellow_dog_dns** | 12 | 28 | 11 | 42.9% |\n| **yellow_dog_dhcpv4** | 1 | 15 | 16 | 6.7% |\n| **yellow_dog_dhcpv6** | 2 | 11 | 9 | 18.2% |\n| **yellow_dog_mdns** | 1 | 12 | 11 | 8.3% |\n| **TOTAL** | **16 modules** | **66** | **47** | **24.2%** |\n\n---\n\n## Modules Prioritized by Importance (Highest First)\n\n### Tier 1: Critical (Complex, Core Logic, No Tests)\n- `YellowDog.Dns.ConnectionProcess` - Query orchestration and async resolution (complex state machine)\n- `YellowDog.Dns.RecursionController` - Recursive DNS resolution with root server queries\n- `YellowDog.Dhcpv6.RelayAgent` - DHCPv6 multi-hop relay forwarding\n\n### Tier 2: Important (Core Infrastructure, No Tests)\n- `YellowDog.Dns.ConnectionManager` - Connection lifecycle management\n- `YellowDog.Dns.ConfigPersistence` - Config orchestration layer\n- `YellowDog.Dns.ZoneStore` - TOML persistence with atomic writes\n- `YellowDog.Dns.ViewManager` - View routing and management\n\n### Tier 3: Essential (Component Infrastructure)\n- `YellowDog.Dns.View` - Individual DNS view implementation\n- `YellowDog.Dns.ViewStore` - View persistence\n- `YellowDog.Dns.ZoneController` - Zone lifecycle\n- `YellowDog.Mdns` - Public API facade\n- `YellowDog.Dhcpv6.Supervisor` - DHCPv6 supervisor\n- `YellowDog.Dhcpv4.Supervisor` - DHCPv4 supervisor\n\n### Tier 4: Complementary (Registry/Store Infrastructure)\n- `YellowDog.Dns.AclRegistry` - ACL lookup registry\n- `YellowDog.Dns.AclStore` - ACL persistence\n- `YellowDog.Dns.Supervisor` - DNS supervisor"},{"type":"text","text":"agentId: a68cb35 (for resuming to continue this agent's work if needed)"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"eb21cfce-0067-4926-ae35-eac907707d9d","uuid":"2618803a-2b04-419b-ae48-6f6ccb07f0ce","tool_use_result":{"status":"completed","prompt":"Search the codebase to find Elixir modules in apps/yellow_dog_dns, apps/yellow_dog_dhcpv4, apps/yellow_dog_dhcpv6, and apps/yellow_dog_mdns that might be missing unit tests. For each app, compare the modules in lib/ directories with test files in test/ directories. Focus on finding modules that have no corresponding test file or have minimal test coverage. Return a list of modules that could benefit from additional unit tests, with the most important ones first.","agentId":"a68cb35","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect. Now I have all the information I need. Let me compile the final report:\n\n## Comprehensive Unit Test Coverage Analysis\n\nB