{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_01J2jq5uA9sLj2xnRkFq4K6K","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01VPxY8fT5LiKmvC92GwQ4og","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"git add apps/yellow_dog_dns/test/yellow_dog/dns/connection_process_test.exs apps/yellow_dog_dns/test/yellow_dog/dns/recursion_controller_test.exs && git commit -m \"$(cat <<'EOF'\ntest(dns): add comprehensive ConnectionProcess and RecursionController unit tests\n\nConnectionProcess tests (41 tests):\n- Process lifecycle (start_link, connection_closed)\n- Query submission (submit_query, submit_raw_data)\n- Query state machine phases (received, firewall, view_routing, etc.)\n- Concurrent query handling (up to 100 simultaneous queries)\n- Timeout handling and SERVFAIL responses\n- Error handling for various DNS rcodes\n- Stats reporting and handler monitoring\n\nRecursionController tests (16 tests):\n- Process lifecycle with Registry integration\n- Stats tracking (query_count, success_count, error_count)\n- Error conditions (format_error for empty queries)\n- UDP message handling (graceful handling of unexpected messages)\n- Concurrent usage (stats calls, format error queries)\n- View name registration (unique names, duplicate detection)\n- Proper cleanup on termination\nEOF\n)\""}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":134,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1046,"cache_read_input_tokens":138209,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1046,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":25,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"84996b7b-e98e-4515-80e7-3bf6c146a135","uuid":"742ade81-24da-42a5-a456-a260dda6697d"}
