e table was already gone\n   - Fixed by changing test to verify process death rather than ETS table deletion\n   - All 78 tests passed\n   - Committed as 1cffea6: \"test(dns): add comprehensive View and View.ACL unit tests\"\n   - Updated CONTINUITY.md\n\n6. **DNS ZoneController Tests** (Current Work):\n   - Explored ZoneController (DynamicSupervisor for zone processes)\n   - Read zone/forward.ex to understand zone structure\n   - Created zone_controller_test.exs with 24 tests\n   - First run: 20 failures due to missing YellowDog.Dns.ZoneRegistry\n   - Fixed by adding setup_all to start the Registry\n   - Second run: 8 failures due to on_exit cleanup issues (supervisor already stopped)\n   - Currently fixing: Updated on_exit to use try/catch for cleanup\n\nKey files created/modified:\n- apps/yellow_dog_mdns/test/yellow_dog/mdns_test.exs (fixed)\n- apps/yellow_dog_dns/test/yellow_dog/dns/view_test.exs (created)\n- apps/yellow_dog_dns/test/yellow_dog/dns/view/acl_test.exs (created)\n- apps/yellow_dog_dns/test/yellow_dog/dns/zone_controller_test.exs (created, in progress)\n- .loki/CONTINUITY.md (updated)\n\nUser messages: Only the initial Loki Mode trigger message from the compacted context - no new user messages in this session.\n\nSummary:\n1. Primary Request and Intent:\n   The user triggered \"Loki Mode - Resume iteration #6 (retry #5)\" which is an autonomous continuous improvement mode. Key requirements from the compacted context:\n   - Follow Reason-Act-Reflect-VERIFY cycle\n   - Read .loki/CONTINUITY.md to avoid past mistakes\n   - Check resources.json for system warnings\n   - Execute tasks, write code, commit changes atomically\n   - Run automated tests for verification\n   - Never stop - always find next improvement\n   - SDLC phases: UNIT_TESTS, API_TESTS, E2E_TESTS, SECURITY, INTEGRATION, CODE_REVIEW\n\n2. Key Technical Concepts:\n   - Elixir umbrella project with 11 apps\n   - GenServer patterns and testing\n   - DynamicSupervisor for zone management\n   - Registry-based process naming\n   - ExUnit testing with setup_all vs setup patterns\n   - Process trapping exits for error testing\n   - ETS tables for caching\n   - ACL (Access Control List) with CIDR parsing and IPv4/IPv6 support\n   - DNS View architecture with zone routing and RPZ policies\n\n3. Files and Code Sections:\n   \n   - **apps/yellow_dog_mdns/test/yellow_dog/mdns_test.exs** (fixed setup_all)\n     - Fixed process lifecycle management to avoid conflicts with NetworkMonitorTest\n     ```elixir\n     setup_all do\n       {registry_pid, registry_started} =\n         case ServiceRegistry.start_link([]) do\n           {:ok, pid} -> {pid, true}\n           {:error, {:already_started, pid}} -> {pid, false}\n         end\n       # ... similar for NetworkMonitor and MessageCache\n       on_exit(fn ->\n         if registry_started and Process.alive?(registry_pid), do: GenServer.stop(registry_pid, :normal, 100)\n         # ...\n       end)\n       {:ok, registry_pid: registry_pid, ...}\n     end\n     ```\n\n   - **apps/yellow_dog_dns/test/yellow_dog/dns/view_test.exs** (created - 34 tests)\n     - Tests View GenServer functionality: start_link, ACL matching, zone/RPZ registration, reload, stats\n     ```elixir\n     setup_all do\n       case Registry.start_link(keys: :unique, name: YellowDog.Dns.ViewRegistry) do\n         {:ok, _pid} -> :ok\n         {:error, {:already_started, _pid}} -> :ok\n       end\n       :ok\n     end\n     ```\n\n   - **apps/yellow_dog_dns/test/yellow_dog/dns/view/acl_test.exs** (created - 44 tests)\n     - Tests ACL struct creation, IPv4/IPv6 matching, built-in ACLs, CIDR parsing, rule evaluation\n\n   - **apps/yellow_dog_dns/test/yellow_dog/dns/zone_controller_test.exs** (created - 24 tests, in progress)\n     - Tests DynamicSupervisor for zone processes\n     ```elixir\n     setup_all do\n       case Registry.start_link(keys: :unique, name: YellowDog.Dns.ZoneRegistry) do\n         {:ok, _pid} -> :ok\n         {:error, {:already_started, _pid}} -> :ok\n       end\n       :ok\n     end\n\n     setup do\n       name = :\"zone_controller_test_#{:rand.uniform(1_000_000)}\"\n       {:ok, pid} = ZoneController.start_link(name: name)\n       on_exit(fn ->\n         try do\n           if Process.alive?(pid), do: Supervisor.stop(pid, :normal, 100)\n         catch\n           :exit, _ -> :ok\n         end\n       end)\n       {:ok, supervisor: pid, name: name}\n     end\n     ```\n\n   - **.loki/CONTINUITY.md** (updated to iteration 19)\n     - Added mDNS public API tests completion\n     - Added DNS View and View.ACL tests completion\n     - Updated commits list with bef6833, 1cffea6\n\n4. Errors and fixes:\n   - **NetworkMonitorTest conflicts (48 failures)**: mdns_test.exs setup_all started NetworkMonitor which conflicted with NetworkMonitorTest's start_supervised!\n     - Fix: Track which processes were started by us and only cleanup those in on_exit\n   \n   - **ETS cache termination test failed**: Test checked if ETS table existed after GenServer.stop but table was already gone\n     - Fix: Changed test to verify process death instead of explicit table deletion\n   \n   - **ZoneRegistry not found (20 failures)**: Zone processes require YellowDog.Dns.ZoneRegistry\n     - Fix: Added setup_all to start the Registry before tests\n   \n   - **on_exit cleanup errors (8 failures)**: Supervisor already stopped when on_exit runs\n     - Fix: Added try/catch around Supervisor.stop in on_exit callback\n\n5. Problem Solving:\n   - Successfully created and committed mDNS public API tests (51 tests)\n   - Successfully created and committed DNS View tests (34 tests) and ACL tests (44 tests)\n   - Currently fixing ZoneController test cleanup issues\n   - All commits: bef6833 (mDNS tests), 1cffea6 (View tests)\n\n6. All user messages:\n   - Only the initial Loki Mode trigger from compacted context: \"Loki Mode - Resume iteration #6 (retry #5). PRD: ./prd.md. RALPH WIGGUM MODE ACTIVE. Use Reason-Act-Reflect-VERIFY cycle...\"\n\n7. Pending Tasks:\n   - Complete DNS ZoneController unit tests (fix remaining cleanup issues)\n   - Add DNS NameResolver unit tests\n   - Continue test coverage expansion\n\n8. Current Work:\n   Working on DNS ZoneController unit tests. Created the test file with 24 tests covering:\n   - DynamicSupervisor lifecycle (start_link)\n   - Zone process management (start_zone, stop_zone, find_zone)\n   - Zone listing (list_zones, list_zones_for_view)\n   - View scoping of zones\n   - Concurrent operations\n   - Error handling\n   \n   Most recent error: 8 test failures due to on_exit cleanup issues where the supervisor was already stopped. Just applied fix:\n   ```elixir\n   on_exit(fn ->\n     try do\n       if Process.alive?(pid), do: Supervisor.stop(pid, :normal, 100)\n     catch\n       :exit, _ -> :ok\n     end\n   end)\n   ```\n\n9. Optional Next Step:\n   Run the ZoneController tests again to verify the on_exit fix works:\n   ```bash\n   cd /home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/yellow_dog_dns && mix test test/yellow_dog/dns/zone_controller_test.exs --trace\n   ```\n   \n   If tests pass, commit the ZoneController tests and continue with DNS NameResolver tests.\n\nIf you need specific details from before compaction (like exact code snippets, error messages, or content you generated), read the full transcript at: /home/gao/.claude/projects/-home-gao-Workspace-gsmlg-dev-yellow-dog/84996b7b-e98e-4515-80e7-3bf6c146a135.jsonl\nPlease continue the conversation from where we left it off without asking the user any further questions. Continue with the last task that you were asked to work on."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"84996b7b-e98e-4515-80e7-3bf6c146a135","uuid":"ed7760e7-a020-4609-b096-555ac957a7d8","isSynthetic":true}
