{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01LGei2agDnqXxf1G55u5whT","type":"tool_result","content":"   470→\n   471→### Completed (Iteration 19 - mDNS Public API Facade Tests)\n   472→- [x] Created comprehensive YellowDog.Mdns public API unit tests (bef6833)\n   473→  - 51 test cases covering the public API facade module\n   474→  - Module exports verification (18 tests for all public functions)\n   475→  - Service registration API: register_service, update_service, toggle_service, unregister_service\n   476→  - Network discovery API: list_discovered_services, get_discovered_service, discover_services, network_stats\n   477→  - Cache API: query, list_all, stats, clear_cache\n   478→  - Status API: running state, network_stats, registry_stats\n   479→  - Delegation pattern verification (ensures facade properly delegates to underlying modules)\n   480→  - Edge cases: unicode names, special characters, high ports, empty TXT records\n   481→  - Fixed setup_all/on_exit cleanup to avoid GenServer conflicts with NetworkMonitorTest\n   482→- [x] All 1250+ tests pass across umbrella\n   483→\n   484→### Completed (Iteration 19 continued - DNS View Module Tests)\n   485→- [x] Created comprehensive DNS View unit tests (1cffea6)\n   486→  - 34 test cases covering View GenServer functionality\n   487→  - Process lifecycle: start_link with keyword/map configs, termination cleanup\n   488→  - ACL matching: :any, :all, inline rules, named ACLs, ACL structs\n   489→  - Zone registration: register_zone/3, multiple zones, deduplication\n   490→  - RPZ zone registration: register_rpz_zone/2, multiple zones, deduplication\n   491→  - Configuration reload: priority, zones, recursion_enabled, value preservation\n   492→  - Stats tracking: initial values, configuration included in stats\n   493→  - handle_info: cancel_query, unknown messages\n   494→  - Concurrent usage: parallel stats and matches? calls\n   495→  - Multiple views: independent state, different view names\n   496→- [x] Created comprehensive DNS View.ACL unit tests (1cffea6)\n   497→  - 44 test cases covering Access Control List functionality\n   498→  - ACL struct creation: new/2 with name, rules, empty rules\n   499→  - IPv4 matching: subnet with prefix, exact IP, CIDR string notation\n   500→  - IPv6 matching: subnet with prefix, CIDR string, loopback ::1\n   501→  - Built-in ACLs: any (matches all), none (matches none), localhost, localnets\n   502→  - Rule evaluation: first-match-wins semantics, allow/deny order\n   503→  - CIDR parsing: IPv4/IPv6 formats, error handling for invalid formats\n   504→  - Edge cases: /0 (match all), /32 (exact match), mixed IP versions\n   505→- [x] All 1300+ tests pass across umbrella\n   506→\n   507→### Completed (Iteration 20 - DNS Persistence Layer Tests)\n   508→- [x] Created comprehensive DNS ZoneController unit tests (0a155ff)\n   509→  - 24 test cases covering DynamicSupervisor for zone processes\n   510→  - Process lifecycle: start_link with default/custom names\n   511→  - Zone management: start_zone, stop_zone, find_zone\n   512→  - Zone listing: list_zones, list_zones_for_view\n   513→  - View scoping: same zone name in different views\n   514→  - Concurrent operations: parallel zone starts, parallel list operations\n   515→  - Error handling: duplicate zones, non-existent zones\n   516→- [x] Created comprehensive DNS ViewStore unit tests (a095393)\n   517→  - 34 test cases covering TOML persistence for view configs\n   518→  - TOML loading: valid files, multiple views, network/geo ACLs\n   519→  - View validation: required fields, priority, ACL entries\n   520→  - File saving: atomic writes, backup creation, parent directory creation\n   521→  - Round-trip persistence: complex configs survive save/load cycle\n   522→  - Edge cases: unicode, long zone lists, quotes, :infinity priority\n   523→- [x] Created comprehensive DNS ZoneStore unit tests (c94f01b)\n   524→  - 45 test cases covering TOML persistence for zone metadata\n   525→  - Zone loading: auth, forward, stub zones with specific configs\n   526→  - View-based keys: view_name:zone_name format parsing\n   527→  - Zone validation: type-specific requirements (forward→upstreams, stub→ns_records)\n   528→  - All 6 zone types: auth, forward, stub, cache, root, rpz\n   529→  - File saving: atomic writes, backup, parent directories\n   530→  - Edge cases: root zone (.), dots in names, unicode, many zones\n   531→- [x] All 427 tests pass in DNS app, 427+ tests across umbrella\n   532→\n   533→### In Progress\n   534→- [ ] Continue test coverage expansion\n   535→\n   536→### Known Issues (All Security Issues Resolved)\n   537→1. ~~**CRITICAL**: Web console has NO authentication~~ **FIXED (b32bbd7)**\n   538→2. ~~**HIGH**: DHCP lease allocation has no rate limiting~~ **FIXED (e8f5f5e, b1096df)**\n   539→3. ~~**MEDIUM**: DNS compression loop vulnerability~~ **ALREADY MITIGATED in ex_dns**\n   540→4. ~~**MEDIUM**: DNS server has no rate limiting~~ **FIXED (a0fcd2b)**\n   541→5. ~~**MEDIUM**: mDNS server has no rate limiting~~ **FIXED (5d535ea)**\n   542→6. ~~**MEDIUM**: Basic auth has no brute-force protection~~ **FIXED (ea14f3c)**\n   543→\n   544→### Next Steps\n   545→1. Add DNS View module unit tests\n   546→2. Add DNS ZoneManager unit tests\n   547→3. Add DNS NameResolver unit tests\n   548→4. Continue test coverage expansion\n   549→\n   550→## Key Findings\n   551→\n   552→### DHCPv6 Handler Bug (FIXED - Iteration 2)\n   553→- Location: `apps/yellow_dog_dhcpv6/lib/yellow_dog/dhcpv6/handler.ex`\n   554→- Issue: Missing `use Abyss.Handler` macro, causing child_spec/1 error\n   555→- Fix: Added `use Abyss.Handler` and `@impl true` annotations\n   556→\n   557→### Abyss Listener Blocking (FIXED - Iteration 2)\n   558→- Location: `apps/abyss/lib/abyss/listener.ex`\n   559→- Issue: `transport.recv(socket, 0, :infinity)` blocked GenServer calls\n   560→- Fix: Changed to `recv(socket, 0, 100)` with retry loop for responsiv